  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Apporter des soins de qualit&#xE9; et un soutien psychologique aux groupes affect&#xE9;s par la crise humanitaire prolong&#xE9;e dans les r&#xE9;gions de S&#xE9;gou, Tombouctou et Kidal au Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide critical health services to vulnerable people affected by conflict-related displacement in Mali. This WHO project provides lifesaving primary health care interventions, mental health and psychosocial support, referral services as well as medical equipment for health facilitates. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 41,445 people, including 7,286 men, 12,386 women, 21,773 children, and 233 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
